  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-20T05:00:09.810Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Build: 801\n\nIf you have a dynamic bone component that affects the Head bone, it will remotely count the Head bone as being 2 dynamic bones. The attached picture shows that for your own avatar it says there's only one dynamic bone, but to everyone else it says there's 2. However in build control panel it says there's only 1, and the dynamic bones are only set to affect the 1 head bone and none of its children. I have tested this with other bones and it seems like only the head bone has this problem.\n\nDemonstration avatar: avtr_fe98725b-4f83-4b37-9248-401a9c38b08f",
